{"id":"2aa4d78fd855f99c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HValueRow.md","title":"HValueRow","display":"HValueRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"HValueRow","parameters":["D","R","m","j","h","z","o","v","z4846","z4847","z4848"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"HValueRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>R</span><span>m</span><span>j</span><span>h</span><span>z</span><span>o</span><span>v</span><span>z4846</span><span>z4847</span><span>z4848</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Heyting 代数语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>m</code>、<code>j</code>、<code>h</code>、<code>z</code>、<code>o</code>、<code>v</code>、<code>z4846</code>、<code>z4847</code>、<code>z4848</code>。</p>\n<p>在给定集合 Heyting 代数上的独立求值。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ HValueRow D R m j h z o v z4846 z4847 z4848)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists a\n  (exists b\n    (and\n      (@ Pair a b z4848)\n      (and\n        (@ HeytingAlgebra D R m j h z o)\n        (and\n          (exists w (and (@ Omega w) (@ Map v w D)))\n          (and\n            (@ FmH a)\n            (and\n              (in b D)\n              (or\n                (exists z4851 (and (@ PAtom z4851 a) (@ App v z4851 b)))\n                (or\n                  (and (@ PBot a) (= b z))\n                  (or\n                    (and (@ PTop a) (= b o))\n                    (or\n                      (exists z4852\n                        (exists z4853\n                          (exists z4854\n                            (exists z4855\n                            (and\n                            (@ PImp z4852 z4853 a)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4856\n                            (exists z4857 (and (in z4856 z4847) (and (@ App z4846 z4856 z4857) (@ Pair z4852 z4854 z4857)))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4858\n                            (exists z4859 (and (in z4858 z4847) (and (@ App z4846 z4858 z4859) (@ Pair z4853 z4855 z4859)))))\n                            (@ BinaryValue h z4854 z4855 b))))))))\n                      (or\n                        (exists z4852\n                          (exists z4853\n                            (exists z4854\n                            (exists z4855\n                            (and\n                            (@ PAnd z4852 z4853 a)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4860\n                            (exists z4861 (and (in z4860 z4847) (and (@ App z4846 z4860 z4861) (@ Pair z4852 z4854 z4861)))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4862\n                            (exists z4863 (and (in z4862 z4847) (and (@ App z4846 z4862 z4863) (@ Pair z4853 z4855 z4863)))))\n                            (@ BinaryValue m z4854 z4855 b))))))))\n                        (exists z4852\n                          (exists z4853\n                            (exists z4854\n                            (exists z4855\n                            (and\n                            (@ POr z4852 z4853 a)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4864\n                            (exists z4865 (and (in z4864 z4847) (and (@ App z4846 z4864 z4865) (@ Pair z4852 z4854 z4865)))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z4866\n                            (exists z4867 (and (in z4866 z4847) (and (@ App z4846 z4866 z4867) (@ Pair z4853 z4855 z4867)))))\n                            (@ BinaryValue j z4854 z4855 b))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8175e0e33cb0689c\" href=\"?note=8175e0e33cb0689c\" title=\"ZFC_BinaryValue\">BinaryValue</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b08bd71c708a439\" href=\"?note=8b08bd71c708a439\" title=\"ZFC_FmH\">FmH</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"23fc3019079f617c\" href=\"?note=23fc3019079f617c\" title=\"ZFC_HeytingAlgebra\">HeytingAlgebra</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" href=\"?note=635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" title=\"ZFC_PAnd\">PAnd</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"892530c42a605aab\" href=\"?note=892530c42a605aab\" title=\"ZFC_POr\">POr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"6d2e5f9b8bceac9f\" href=\"?note=6d2e5f9b8bceac9f\" title=\"ZFC_PTop\">PTop</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"593f9bda